    "detailed_description": "<strong>It's not the same as usual</strong><br><br>Here is a man who has grown tired of the same monotonous days. <br>His dream is to become wealthy and leave behind his life as a regular office worker. <br>But one day, an unexpected opportunity comes his way after he gets off work.<br><br>Is it truly an opportunity, or something else?<br>Escape your endlessly looping room by passing through the mirror.<br><br><strong>Feature</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>After work, face the <i>seven obstacles</i> that stand in your way.<br><br></li><li>Lure specific monsters by <i>whistling 'H' and burping 'R' keys </i><br><br></li><li>Escape so the monsters <i>can't catch you.</i><br><br></li><li><i>Remove all obstacles</i> to achieve your dream<br><br></li><li><i>The picture frame in the room</i> will show the number of obstacles you have overcome.</li></ul>",
